{
  "$comment": [
    "Native library registry: the ONE list of native libraries (Rust crates and the C/C++ modules) and how each is wired.",
    "Read it, do not copy it: tool/native_crates.py (crate lists, source keys, registry validation; tool/native_libs.ps1,",
    "tool/bootstrap.sh, fushi/tool/dist_test/worker_*.sh, .github/actions/native-store-names/names.sh, the macOS / iOS",
    "Xcode phases call it), native/fushi_native_libs.cmake (Windows / Linux CMake, string(JSON)), and the guard",
    "fushi/test/build/native_crate_registry_guard_test.dart (every consumer that still hand-writes wiring must match this file).",
    "Fields: see tool/native_crates.py (Crate / PlatformEntry). platforms.<p>.required: always = missing artifact fails every",
    "build; release = Debug only warns, Profile/Release fails; optional = copy-if-present, with `fallback` describing the",
    "degradation (docs/agent/build.md). bundled_by: app = packaged by the registry-driven app wiring; anything else names the",
    "hand-written owner (left as is, checked by the guard)."
  ],
  "schema": 1,
  "crates": [
    {
